Package: globoriskpexa
Title: Globorisk 10-Year CVD Risk (Laboratory and Office) - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christopher", "Boyer", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of the globorisk R package, source of the calibration data"),
    person("Goodarz", "Danaei", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Senior author of Globorisk"))
Description: Ten-year risk of fatal and non-fatal cardiovascular disease from
    the 2017 laboratory-based and office-based Globorisk risk scores (Ueda et
    al., Lancet Diabetes Endocrinol 2017 <doi:10.1016/S2213-8587(17)30015-3>),
    recalibrated to 182 countries and baseline years 2000 to 2020. Coefficients
    and country calibration data are taken from the authors' globorisk R
    package (MIT licence, commit ea83370). The 2015 fatal-only model and the
    Globorisk-LAC update are not included.
License: GPL-3
